    "body": "## Problem\n\n`:connect`, and `:restart` from a remote client, fail with \"connection\nrefused\" when connecting to a TCP address takes longer than 50 ms, e.g. over\na relayed VPN link.\n\n## Solution\n\nIncrease both connect timeouts to 500 ms, as #36800 did for `--remote-ui`.\n\nDiscussed in #42316.\n\nTested manually with a 200 ms loopback delay (`unshare -rn` + `tc netem`):\n`:connect! 127.0.0.1:7777` and `:restart!` (from a `--remote-ui` client) fail\nbefore this change and work after it.\n",
    "closed_at": null,
